{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Private therapy for adults in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — anxiety, trauma, relationships, burnout. Confidential, evidence-informed care." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="theme-earthy">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="{{THERAPIST_NAME}} avatar" class="avatar">
        <div>
          <h1 class="brand-title">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p class="brand-sub">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a></li>
          <li><a href="approach.html">Approach</a></li>
          <li><a href="fees.html">Fees</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html" class="btn-ghost">Contact</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html" class="btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <button class="mobile-toggle" id="mobileToggle" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h2 class="eyebrow">Private practice therapy in {{CITY}}</h2>
          <h3 class="hero-title">A steady, practical path through anxiety, transitions, and relationship strain</h3>
          <p class="lead">I work with adults who want clearer thinking, more manageable emotions, and sustainable patterns that support richer relationships and work-life balance. Sessions are collaborative and focused on tools you can use between meetings.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button class="btn-secondary" id="openGuide">Download my 5-step guide</button>
          </div>
          <ul class="quick-list">
            <li>Telehealth + in-person ({{CITY}}, {{STATE}})</li>
            <li>Licensed clinician: {{LICENSE}}</li>
            <li>Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="Warm organic illustration of therapy and growth" role="img">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VALUES -->
    <section class="values container" id="values">
      <h4 class="section-title">What guides our work</h4>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h5>Practical, measurable steps</h5>
          <p>I translate therapeutic insights into simple daily experiments that help you notice change and adjust as we go.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h5>Warm nonjudgmental stance</h5>
          <p>We hold curiosity and compassion as central practices; you’ll be seen and heard without rush or pressure.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h5>Evidence-informed blend</h5>
          <p>I draw from cognitive-behavioral, somatic, and relational approaches to fit the client’s needs—not a single protocol for everyone.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- METHODS -->
    <section class="methods container" id="methods">
      <h4 class="section-title">How we’ll work together</h4>
      <div class="method-grid">
        <div>
          <h5>Assessment & shared plan</h5>
          <p>We begin with focused intake to understand what matters most to you and build a clear, collaborative plan.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5>Skill practice between sessions</h5>
          <p>Short, targeted exercises you can use daily—breathing, attention anchors, boundary practices, and brief behavioral experiments.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5>Ongoing review</h5>
          <p>Regular check-ins on what’s working so we can adapt pace and focus without unnecessary repetition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OBJECTIONS -->
    <section class="objections container" id="objections">
      <h4 class="section-title">Common concerns I hear</h4>
      <div class="qa-list">
        <details>
          <summary>Is change possible when life feels so busy?</summary>
          <p>Yes. We prioritize small, high-impact practices you can integrate into an already-full schedule. Therapy needn’t double your workload.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Will you tell my employer what we talk about?</summary>
          <p>No. Sessions are confidential. I won’t share information without your written consent except in rare legal/ethical situations (harm to self/others, court order).</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What if I’m not ready for deep trauma work?</summary>
          <p>We move at a pace you can tolerate. If trauma-focused interventions are appropriate later, we prepare carefully and ensure strong safety supports.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
    <section class="testimonials container" id="testimonials">
      <h4 class="section-title">Client perspectives</h4>
      <div class="test-grid">
        <blockquote>
          "Practical tools and steady support helped me set boundaries at work without losing my calm. I feel more present with my family." — A., 38
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "The clarity I gained around my relationship patterns saved me months of spinning. Sessions felt focused and realistic." — M., 45
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEAD MAGNET -->
    <section class="lead-magnet container" id="lead">
      <div class="lead-inner">
        <div>
          <h4 class="section-title">Free guide: 5 steps to calm when anxiety spikes</h4>
          <p>This short, actionable PDF summarizes a routine you can use immediately when anxiety interrupts your day. No jargon—just steps you can try today.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="leadForm" class="lead-form" aria-label="Download guide">
          <label for="leadEmail" class="sr-only">Email address</label>
          <input id="leadEmail" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send me the guide</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA FOOTER -->
    <section class="final-cta container">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h4>Ready to get started?</h4>
        <p>Schedule a brief 15-minute consultation to see if we’re a good fit.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn-ghost">Contact me</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</strong>
        <p class="small">Private practice therapist offering short-term and longer-term work. Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}. Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and telehealth.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="small">Confidentiality: sessions are private. I will not disclose your information without consent except where required by law (e.g., imminent harm, court order). If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, call emergency services or your local crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-block">
        <p><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
        <p><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal small">
      <p>All care is supportive and non-prescriptive. Therapy does not guarantee specific outcomes. Information here is educational and not a substitute for individualized clinical assessment.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div id="guideModal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <button id="closeModal" class="modal-close">Close</button>
      <h4>Get the guide</h4>
      <p>Enter your email and I’ll send the 5-step PDF for immediate use.</p>
      <form id="modalForm" class="modal-form">
        <input type="email" id="modalEmail" name="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send the guide</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
